    "<section class=\"panel targets-workspace\"><div class=\"panel-heading target-list-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">" + esc(monthLabel.toUpperCase()) + "</p><h3>Team target plan</h3><p>Progress updates from recorded conversions. Any shortfall rolls forward automatically.</p></div><div class=\"target-filters\"><input id=\"targets-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search team\" aria-label=\"Search team\"><select id=\"targets-role\" aria-label=\"Filter by role\"><option value=\"all\">Everyone</option><option value=\"manager\">Managers</option><option value=\"employee\">Employees</option></select></div></div><div class=\"target-plan-note\"><span>↗</span><p><strong>Missed goals don’t disappear.</strong> Uncompleted conversions carry into the next week and remain due until completed.</p></div><p class=\"target-forecast-basis\">Estimates use owner-set pool and split rates. General targets use average sale value from the last 180 days; course targets use the selected course rate. Actual payout follows student payments collected.</p><div class=\"target-people-list\">" + (personCards || "<div class=\"empty-state\"><strong>No active employees yet</strong><p>Add a manager or employee in Team & access, then assign their first goal here.</p><button class=\"button secondary\" data-page=\"team\">Open Team & access</button></div>") + "</div></section>";
